<title>MEXICO: Mexico cattle report, feeder export price - USDA.</title>
<headline>Mexico cattle report, feeder export price - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA reported Thursday that around 1,400 head were exported into the United States at two crossing points on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Through Santa Teresa, New Mexico, around 1,200 head were sold, although not enough to set price trends.</p>
<p>&quot;Around 80 percent of cattle that crossed were sold previously on video...,&quot; USDA said.</p>
<p>Through Del Rio, Texas, around 200 head were sold, although not enough to establish quote or trend prices.</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289530)) E-mail at chris.aspin@reuters.com</p>
</text>
